a href=\"/wiki/Basilisk_Oil\" title=\"Basilisk Oil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/POT_Basilisk_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Basilisk_Oil\" title=\"Basilisk Oil\">Basilisk Oil</a>, which means it can be used to remove the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Petrified\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\">Petrified</a> condition.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-